--- uses: ["core"]
# Minimal reproduction: can instance method bodies see enclosing dict names?
[
  # A regular function defined in this dict
  my-helper: [fn [let x] x]

  # A class
  MyClass: [class [let a]]

  # Instance whose method body references my-helper from the same dict
  MyInstance: [instance MyClass
    [let a@Integer]: [method: my-helper]]
]
[my-helper 42]
